{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10373","headline":"同羣公秋登琴台 · 高适","name":"同羣公秋登琴台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古迹使人感，琴台空寂寥。\n静然顾遗尘，千载如昨朝。\n临眺自兹始，羣贤久相邀。\n德与形神高，孰知天地遥。\n四时何倏忽，六月鸣秋蜩。\n万象归白帝，平川横赤霄。\n犹是对夏伏，几时有凉飙。\n燕雀满檐楹，鸿鹄抟扶摇。\n物性各自得，我心在渔樵。\n兀然还复醉，尚握尊中瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}